   "pediatricMarkdown": {
    "id": 1451266626,
    "html": "<p>Guideline excerpt: &quot;Citalopram, escitalopram, and sertraline had the most pharmacogenetic data supporting potential genotype-guided prescribing changes in children (Table S1). Based on this evidence, the recommendations for these drugs are relevant to pediatric patients and are consistent with smaller pharmacokinetic studies available for this population.&quot;</p>\n"
